  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/conan-io/conan/tarball/2.32.0",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/conan-io/conan/zipball/2.32.0",
  "body": "- Feature: Add basic LoongArch64 architecture support and host detection. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20288)\r\n- Feature: Add support for `Xcode 26.6`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20280)\r\n- Feature: Add support for `gcc 16.2`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20280)\r\n- Feature: Parse reference attributes from `--ref` in `workspace add`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20269)\r\n- Feature: Add ``raise_on_errors=True`` arg to ``CommandAPI.run``, it now raises on all errors returned by commands. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20266)\r\n- Feature: `XcodeToolchain` now accepts arbitrary extra xcconfig settings via `tc.build_settings`, for build settings with no dedicated conf. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20256). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4524)\r\n- Feature: ``conan workspace open`` with no arguments will read the ``conanws`` file and try to open the defined references there into their respective folders if they are not present. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20247). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4529)\r\n- Feature: ``conan workspace open`` and ``conan workspace add --ref`` learned a new ``--folder`` argument to indicate the relative location wrt the workspace root for the cloning of the repository. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20247). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4529)\r\n- Feature: Add `architecture_bits` build helper to detect when the target architecture is 64-bit. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20246). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4522)\r\n- Feature: Compute `CMAKE_Swift_COMPILER_TARGET` in `CMakeToolchain` for Apple Swift cross-builds. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20243). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4515)\r\n- Feature: Add `recipe_metadata()`/`package_metadata()` API to download metadata to a user folder. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20240). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4514)\r\n- Feature: Improve ``source`` step output. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20234)\r\n- Feature: Make `conan report diff -f=html` use a dark theme by default. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20229)\r\n- Feature: Add `package_type_traits` attribute to force requirement traits by `package_type` (`run` only for now). (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20228). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4526)\r\n- Feature: Add `--ref` argument to `conan editable add <path>` as a shortcut to define name, version, etc. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20218)\r\n- Feature: Feature: Allow `copy()` to accept multiple patterns, also used by `exports`/`exports_sources`, for speedup. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20217). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4512)\r\n- Feature: Add `qbs_file_name` property to override the generated Qbs module name and avoid collisions. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20215). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4520)\r\n- Feature: Allow `conan run` without a conanfile to run executables from the profile's `[tool_requires]`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20214). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4511)\r\n- Feature: Rework the `conan graph build-order` HTML formatter with search and full offline support. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20174)\r\n- Feature: Populate the download cache with uploaded artifacts if `core.download:download_cache` is set. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20163). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4518)\r\n- Feature: Accept CMake 4.4 `--preset-file` presets generated outside the CMake root. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20158). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4528)\r\n- Feature: Add `!settings.build_type` syntax to exclude `build_type` from `cmake_layout`'s `build_folder_vars`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/17331). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4527)\r\n- Fix: Do not force `CONFIG` requires for transitive dependencies in `CMakeConfigDeps`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20283)\r\n- Fix: Correct a typo in the CycloneDX component recipe revision. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20271)\r\n- Fix: Failed creates in ``workspace`` subcommands now raise errors as expected. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20266)\r\n- Fix: Add support for python requires in remotes for `conan workspace create`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20265)\r\n- Fix: Add support for lockfile reading in `conan source` for Python requires. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20264)\r\n- Fix: Generate valid CycloneDX SBOMs for recipes without a `description` attribute. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20263)\r\n- Fix: Match the `dll.a` extension (MinGW) in `deduce_full_cpp_info`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20259)\r\n- Fix: Make `test_linker_script` test resilient to the exact linker error text, which changed with Meson >= 1.12. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20257)\r\n- Fix: `XcodeToolchain`'s extra flags (`tools.build:cflags/cxxflags/ldflags/defines`) no longer get overwritten when installing more than one configuration for the same project. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20255). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4523)\r\n- Fix: Correct filename parsing in `conan report diff -f=html` for non-ASCII filenames. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20229)\r\n- Fix: Remove the Vigenère cipher used to store JWTs, since it provided no real security benefit. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20227)\r\n- Fix: Improve `copy()` performance when using lists of patterns. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20226)\r\n- Fix: Warn when `tools.build:compiler_executables` keys are unknown or unused by `CMakeToolchain`/`AutotoolsToolchain`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20219). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4513)\r\n- Fix: Add `objc`, `objcpp` and `asm` as `tools.build:compiler_executables` for `AutotoolsToolchain`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20219). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4513)\r\n- Fix: Make `conan lock upgrade-config`'s `path` argument point to a `conanconfig.yml` file, not a `conanfile.py`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20208). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4510)\r\n- Fix: Remove the deprecated `--order-by` behavior and empty version ranges, as planned for Conan 2.32. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20207). Docs: [:page_with_curl:](https://github.com/conan-io/docs/pull/4517)\r\n- Bugfix: intel-cc default compilers on Windows. Classic mode now defaults to `icl` (not `icc`/`icpc`), icx mode to `icx` (not `icx-cl`, which is absent in older oneAPI), and CMakeToolchain now honors `CC`/`CXX` from `[buildenv]` over the hard-coded defaults. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20233)\r\n- Bugfix: Keep the local recipe index cache folder when `conan remote add` fails on a duplicate without `--force`. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20210)\r\n- Bugfix: Make `CMakeConfigDeps` generate common files only for the host context, avoiding lost CMake variables. (https://github.com/conan-io/conan/pull/20198)",
